&\leq \left( \frac{2^d \|B \|_2^2}{\varepsilon/2} \right)  \left( h/k^{1/d} \right)^{2\beta}
\end{align*}
where the first line follows by definition, and since $p_\ell \geq (h/2)^d/k$, and $B \left( \frac{x-m_j}{h/k^{1/d}}  \right)=0$  outside of the cube $\mathcal{C}_{h/k^{1/d}}(m_j)$, which implies that 
