Similarly, (minus) the conditional mean of the second-order influence function term is
\begin{align}
&-\mathbb{E}\{   \rho_h(X_1) K_h(X_1) \widehat\varphi_{y2}(Z_1,Z_2)K_h(X_2) \mid D^n \} \nonumber \\
